 Welcome to The Ascmearc. Press ? for controls. The pass opens on the Ascmearc. Far to the east,
 Fyrbeorg smokes.





              ┌─ Maren's story ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
              │                                                                      │
              │  Your father was a smith, and the ring of his hammer was the first   │
              │  music you knew. You were born without sign or omen, which your      │
              │  father counted a mercy.                                             │
              │                                                                      │
              │  You were a child like any other, and nobody wrote down what you     │
              │  did. You worked, as everyone worked, and nothing of it is worth     │
              │  the telling.                                                        │
              │                                                                      │
              │  No great grief found you, and you count that luck, as you should.   │
              │  Fortune never found your door; whatever you have, you got           │
              │  yourself.                                                           │
              │                                                                      │
              │  A letter came, in a hand you did not know, with a little money in   │
              │  it and three words: Come. There's work. You walked up with a        │
              │  pedlar who talked the whole way and sold you a knife at the top     │
              │  for twice its worth. 'Yer'll want that, where yer goin',' he said,  │
              │  and he was right.                                                   │
              │                                                                      │
              │ Enter continue                                                       │
              └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘






